#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Analog electricity"
msgstr "Electricidade analóxica"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Create and simulate an analog electric schema."
msgstr "Crear e simular un esquema eléctrico analóxico."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Create an analog electric schema with a real time simulation."
msgstr "Crear libremente un esquema eléctrico analóxico cunha simulación súa en tempo real."

#. Help prerequisite
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Requires some basic understanding of the concept of electricity."
msgstr "Require unha comprensión básica do concepto da electricidade."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Drag electrical components from the selector and drop them in the working area. In the working area, you can move the components by dragging them."
msgstr "Arrastra compoñentes eléctricos do selector e sóltaos na área de traballo. Dentro da área de traballo podes mover os compoñentes pinchando neles."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "To delete a component or wire, select the deletion tool on top of the component selector, and select the component or wire."
msgstr "Para eliminar un compoñente ou cable escolle a ferramenta de borrado de enriba do selector de compoñentes, e selecciona o compoñente ou cable a borrar."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "You can click on the component and then on the rotate buttons to rotate it or on the info button to get information about it."
msgstr "Premer no compoñente e despois nos botóns de rotar para xiralo, ou no botón de información para obter información sobre el."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "You can click on the switch to open and close it. Likewise, you can change the rheostat value by dragging its slider."
msgstr "Preme no interruptor para abrilo e pechalo. Para cambiar o valor do reóstato pincha e arrastra o regulador."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "To connect two terminals, click on the first terminal, then on the second terminal. To deselect a terminal, click on any empty area."
msgstr "Para conectar dúas terminais preme na primeira terminal, e despois na segunda terminal. Para cancelar preme nunha área baleira."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "For repairing a broken bulb or LED, click on it after disconnecting it from the circuit. The simulation is updated in real time by any user action."
msgstr "Para reparar unha lámpada ou LED estragados desconéctaos do circuíto e preme neles. A simulación actualízase inmediatamente tras calquera acción do usuario."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The electric simulation engine is from edX: "
msgstr "O motor da simulación eléctrica é de edX: "

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/cktsim.js:138
msgctxt "cktsim|"
msgid "Warning! Circuit has a voltage source loop or a source shorted by a wire, please remove the wire causing the short."
msgstr "Coidado! O circuíto ten un bucle nunha fonte de voltaxe, ou un curtocircuíto. Elimina o cable culpable."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/cktsim.js:139
msgctxt "cktsim|"
msgid "Warning! Simulator might produce meaningless results or no result with this circuit."
msgstr "Coidado! Os datos da simulación deste circuíto poden ser absurdos."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Battery.qml:19
msgctxt "Battery|"
msgid "Battery is used for powering up electrical devices. It can supply voltage in a closed circuit. Which means there should be a path for the current to flow from one terminal of the battery to the other."
msgstr "A batería úsase para darlle corrente aos dispositivos electrónicos. Tamén pode meter voltaxe nun circuíto pechado. O que significa que se precisa que exista algún xeito de que a corrente chegue dun polo da batería ao outro."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Battery.qml:19
msgctxt "Battery|"
msgid "If the current in a circuit is too high then the battery can be damaged."
msgstr "As baterías poden danarse se hai demasiada corrente no circuíto."

#. 1st V for Voltage, 2nd V for Volt
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Battery.qml:21
#, qt-format
msgctxt "Battery|"
msgid "V = %1V"
msgstr "V = %1V"

#. I for current intensity, A for Ampere
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Battery.qml:23
#, qt-format
msgctxt "Battery|"
msgid "I = %1A"
msgstr "I = %1A"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Bulb.qml:19
msgctxt "Bulb|"
msgid "Bulb glows when it has enough power. Its intensity is proportional to the supplied voltage. It will be broken if there is a power greater than a certain limit."
msgstr "As lámpadas ilumínanse cando teñen corrente dabondo. A intensidade é proporcional ao voltaxe subministrado, pero queimarase se se sobrepasa o seu límite."

#. 1st V for Voltage, 2nd V for Volt
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/analog_electricity/components/Bulb.qml:21
#, qt-format
