msgid "The leftmost column contains 4 ducks, clicking on one of them produces a sound and an animation."
msgstr "A columna da esquerda contén 4 patos, e pulsar neles reproduce unha animación e un son."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/baby_mouse/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The central area contains a blue duck, moving the mouse cursor or doing a drag gesture on a touchscreen makes the blue duck move."
msgstr "A área central contén un pato azul, mover o punteiro do rato ou arrastrando co dedo fai que o pato se mova."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/baby_mouse/ActivityInfo.qml:26
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The arrows area, clicking on one of them makes the blue duck move in the corresponding direction."
msgstr "Premendo algunha das frechas na outra área fará que o pato se mova na dirección correspondente."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/baby_mouse/ActivityInfo.qml:27
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Doing a simple click in the central area shows a marker at the click position."
msgstr "Premendo na área central amosa un marcador no punto onde se premeu."

