#. Activity title - the game is the KenKen but we cannot use KenKen as it is a trademark name
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/ActivityInfo.qml:14
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Calcudoku"
msgstr "Calcudoku"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/ActivityInfo.qml:16
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Solve the Calcudoku."
msgstr "Resolve o calcudoku."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/ActivityInfo.qml:19
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Develop your logical reasoning skills: data linking, deduction and spatial location while using calculation."
msgstr "Desenvolver as habilidades de razoamento lóxico: relación de datos, dedución e localización espacial ao usar cálculo."

#. Help prerequisite
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/ActivityInfo.qml:21
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Completing the puzzle requires patience and arithmetic abilities."
msgstr "Completar o quebracabezas require paciencia e habilidade aritmética."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Select a number in the list and click on its target position to fill the grid. Each number must appear only once in a row and in a column. Cages are groups of cells providing information on how to fill them. Cages made of more than one cell provide a result and an operator: all the numbers in the cage, when combined using the operator, must produce the result. Cages made of only one cell directly provide the number to enter."
msgstr "Seleccionar un número da lista e premer a súa posición de destino para encher a grade. Cada número debe aparecer só unha vez por fila e columna. As gaiolas son grupos de celas que fornecer información sobre como enchelas. As gaiolas de máis dunha cela fornecen un resultado e un operador: todos os números da gaiola, cando se combinan usando o operador, deben producir o resultado. As gaiolas feitas de só unha cela fornecen directamente o número para inserir."

#. + is the unicode character for addition mathematical operator (+)
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/calcudoku/resource/1/Data.qml:66
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Small grids with + operator."
msgstr "Grades pequenas co operador +."

#. + is the unicode character for addition mathematical operator (+), − for subtraction (-)
