#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Operate a canal lock"
msgstr "Manexa unha esclusa"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Tux is in trouble, and needs to take his boat through a lock. Help Tux and find out how a canal lock works."
msgstr "Tux ten problemas e precisa levar o seu barco a través dunha esclusa. Axuda a Tux e descubre como funciona unha esclusa."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Understand how a canal lock works."
msgstr "Entender como funciona as esclusas."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "You are in charge of the canal lock. Open the gates and the locks in the right order, so that Tux can travel through the gates in both directions."
msgstr "Estás a cargo da esclusa. Abre as comportas e as esclusas na orde correcta para que Tux poida atravesalas nas dúas direccións."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/CanalLock.qml:57
msgctxt "CanalLock|"
msgid "Your goal is to lead Tux across the canal lock to get the wooden logs, using the different types of water locks available."
msgstr "O teu obxectivo é levar a Tux ao outro lado da esclusa da canle para coller os troncos de madeira, usando os distintos tipos de esclusas dispoñíbeis."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/CanalLock.qml:59
msgctxt "CanalLock|"
msgid "The vertical colored bars represent the water locks, which can be operated by clicking on them. Two locks of the same type cannot be operated simultaneously."
msgstr "As barras coloradas verticais representan esclusas de auga que podes operar preméndoas. Dúas esclusas do mesmo tipo non poden operarse simultaneamente."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/canal_lock/CanalLock.qml:61
msgctxt "CanalLock|"
msgid "The water level inside the lock will change according to the side of the canal it is connected to. Use this property to help Tux get the job done."
msgstr "O nivel da auga dentro da esclusa cambiará segundo o lado da canle co que está conectada. Use esta propiedade para axudar a Tux a completar o traballo."

