msgid "Set the clock to the given time. Drag the different hands to control their respective unit."
msgstr "Pon o reloxo na hora indicada. Pincha e arrastra as agullas para controlar cadansúa unidade."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/clockgame/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The shortest hand indicates the hours, a longer hand indicates the minutes, and the longest hand indicates the seconds."
msgstr "A agulla pequena indica as horas, a mediana os minutos e a grande os segundos."

