#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Mixing paint colors"
msgstr "Mesturando as cores de pintura"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Discover paint color mixing."
msgstr "Descubre a mestura de cores."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:20
#: activities/color_mix_light/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Mix primary colors to match the given color."
msgstr "Mestura as cores primarias para coincidir coa cor indicada."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "This activity teaches how mixing primary paint colors works (subtractive mixing)."
msgstr "Esta actividade ensina que ocorre ao mesturar as cores primarias en pintura (mestura subtractiva)."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Paints and inks absorb different colors of the light falling on it, subtracting it from what you see. The more ink you add, the more light is absorbed, and the darker the resulting color becomes. We can mix just three primary colors to make many new colors. The primary colors for paint/ink are cyan (a special shade of blue), magenta (a special shade of pink), and yellow."
msgstr "As pinturas e tintas absorben diferentes cores da luz, restando da luz visíbel. Canta máis tinta engadas máis luz se absorbe, e máis escura é a cor resultante. Xuntando só as tres cores primarias podemos crear moitas máis cores novas. No caso da tinta as cores primarias son o ciano (unha especie de azul), maxenta (unha especie de rosa) e amarelo."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Change the color by moving the sliders on the tubes of paint or by clicking on the + and - buttons. Then click on the OK button to validate your answer."
msgstr "Move os indicadores nos tubos de pintura para cambiar a cor, ou preme nos botóns + e -. Cando remates pulsa en Aceptar."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/color_mix/ColorMix.qml:88
msgctxt "ColorMix|"
msgid "Match the color"
msgstr "Fai coincidir a cor"

