#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/crane/ActivityInfo.qml:29
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Move the items in the blue frame to match their position in the model frame. To select an item, just click on it. Next to the crane, you will find four arrows that let you move the selected item. You can also swipe up/down/left/right to move the selected item."
