#: activities/graph-coloring/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Learn to distinguish between different colors/shapes and learn about relative positions."
msgstr "Aprende a distinguir entre distintas cores e formas, e aprende sobre as posicións relativas."

#. Help prerequisite
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/graph-coloring/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Ability to distinguish different colors/shapes, sense of positions."
msgstr "Capacidade para distinguir distintas cores e formas, sentido das posicións."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/graph-coloring/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Place colors/shapes on the graph so that no two adjacent nodes have the same color. Select a node, then select an item in the list to place it on the node."
msgstr "Colora cores e formas no gráfico para ningunha parella de nodos contiguos teña a mesma cor. Selecciona un nodo e logo un elemento da lista para colocalo no nodo."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/graph-coloring/ActivityInfo.qml:26
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Right and Left arrows: navigate"
msgstr "Frechas dereita e esquerda: navegar"

#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/ActivityInfo.qml:19
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Gravity"
msgstr "Gravidade"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/ActivityInfo.qml:21
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Introduction to the concept of gravity."
msgstr "Introdución do concepto de gravidade."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Move the spaceship to avoid hitting the planets and reach the space station."
msgstr "Move a nave para esquivar os planetas e acadar a estación espacial."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/ActivityInfo.qml:27
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Move the spaceship with the left and right keys, or with the buttons on the screen for mobile devices. Try to stay near the center of the screen and anticipate by looking at the size and direction of the arrow showing the gravity force."
msgstr "Move a nave espacial coas teclas esquerda e dereita ou cos botóns da pantalla se usas un dispositivo móbil. Intenta quedar preto do centro e prepárate observando o tamaño e a dirección da frecha que amosa a forza gravitacional."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/ActivityInfo.qml:29
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Left and Right arrows: move the spaceship"
msgstr "Frechas dereita e esquerda: mover a nave espacial"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/Gravity.qml:210
msgctxt "Gravity|"
msgid "Gravity is universal and Newton's law of universal gravitation extends gravity beyond earth. This force of gravitational attraction is directly dependent upon the mass of both objects and inversely proportional to the square of the distance between their centers."
msgstr "A gravidade é universal e a lei de Newton de gravitación universal estende a gravidade alén da Terra. Esta forza de atracción gravitacional depende directamente da masa dos dous obxectos, e é inversamente proporcional ao cadrado da distancia entre os seus centros."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/Gravity.qml:214
msgctxt "Gravity|"
msgid "Since the gravitational force is directly proportional to the mass of both interacting objects, more massive objects will attract each other with a greater gravitational force."
msgstr "Dado que a forza gravitacional é directamente proporcional á masa dos dous obxectos que interactúan, os obxectos con maior masa atraeranse con máis forza."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/Gravity.qml:217
msgctxt "Gravity|"
msgid "But as this force is inversely proportional to the square of the distance between the two interacting objects, more distance will result in weaker gravitational force."
msgstr "Pero esta forza é inversamente proporcional ao cadrado da distancia entre os dous obxectos, canto maior é a distancia, menor é a forza de atracción."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/Gravity.qml:220
msgctxt "Gravity|"
msgid "Your goal is to move the spaceship and avoid hitting the planets until you reach the space station. The arrow indicates the direction and the intensity of the gravity on your ship."
msgstr "O teu obxectivo é mover nave espacial e evitar golpear os planetas ata chegar á estación espacial. A frecha indica a dirección e a intensidade que a gravidade exerce sobre a nave."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/gravity/Gravity.qml:223
msgctxt "Gravity|"
msgid "Try to stay near the center of the screen, and anticipate by looking at the size and direction of the arrow."
msgstr "Intenta quedar preto do centro e prepárate observando o tamaño e a dirección da frecha que amosa a forza gravitacional."

