#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Land safe"
msgstr "Aterra con seguridade"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Pilot the spaceship towards the green landing area."
msgstr "Pilota unha nave espacial ata a zona verde de aterraxe."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Understand the acceleration caused by the gravity."
msgstr "Comprende a aceleración causada pola gravidade."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The acceleration caused by the gravity experienced by the spaceship is directly proportional to the mass of the planet and inversely proportional to the square of the distance from the center of the planet. Thus, with every planet the acceleration will differ and as the spaceship comes closer and closer to the planet the acceleration increases."
msgstr "A aceleración causada pola gravidade que experimenta a nave espacial é directamente proporcional á masa do planeta e inversamente proporcionar ao cadrado da distancia do centro do planeta. Polo tanto, con cada planeta a aceleración será distinta e a medida que a nave espacial se achegue ao planeta a aceleración aumentará."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "In first levels, use the up/down keys to control the thrust and the right/left keys to control the direction. On touch screens you can control the rocket through the corresponding on-screen buttons."
msgstr "Nos primeiros niveis, usa as teclas de arriba e abaixo para controlar o impulso e as teclas de dereita e esquerda para controlar a dirección. Se usas unha pantalla táctil, podes controlar o foguete cos botóns correspondentes da pantalla."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "In higher levels, you can use the right/left keys to rotate the spaceship. By rotating the spaceship you can trigger an acceleration in non-vertical direction using the up/down keys."
msgstr "Nos niveis superiores, podes usar as teclas dereita e esquerda para rotar a nave espacial. Ao rotar a nave espacial podes causar unha aceleración en dirección non vertical mediante as teclas de arriba e abaixo."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:26
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The landing platform is green if your speed is fine for a safe landing."
msgstr "A plataforma de aterraxe está en verde se a velocidade é axeitada para unha aterraxe segura."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:27
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "The accelerometer on the right border shows your rocket's overall vertical acceleration including gravitational force. In the upper green area of the accelerometer your acceleration is higher than the gravitational force, in the lower red area it's lower, and on the blue baseline in the yellow middle area the two forces cancel each other out."
msgstr "O acelerómetro do bordo dereito amosa a aceleración vertical total do foguete, incluída a forza gravitacional. Na zona verde superior do acelerómetro a túa aceleración supera a forza gravitacional, na vermella inferior ao revés, e na liña base azul da zona central amarela as dúas forzas se cancelan entre elas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:29
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Up and Down arrows: control the thrust of the rear engine"
msgstr "Frechas de arriba e abaixo: controlar o impulso do motor traseiro"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/land_safe/ActivityInfo.qml:30
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Left and Right arrows: at first levels, move to the sides; at higher levels, rotate the spaceship"
msgstr "Frechas de esquerda e dereita: nos primeiros niveis, mover aos lados; en niveis superiores, rotar a nave espacial."

