msgid "Maze"
msgstr "Labirinto"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Help Tux get out of this maze."
msgstr "Axuda a Tux a saír deste labirinto."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:22
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Use the arrow keys or swipe the screen to move Tux to the door."
msgstr "Usa as teclas de frecha ou pasa o dedo pola pantalla para mover a Tux á porta."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "In first levels, Tux walks comfortably, one step on each move request, through the maze."
msgstr "Nos primeiros niveis, Tux camiña comodamente, dando un paso a través do labirinto cada vez que premes a tecla correspondente."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:24
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:24
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "For larger mazes, there is a special walking mode, called \"run-fast-mode\". If this run-fast-mode is enabled, Tux will run all the way automatically until he reaches a fork and you have to decide which way to go further."
msgstr "Para os labirintos máis longos podes activar o modo de correr. No modo de correr, Tux corre todo o camiño automaticamente ata que chega a unha encrucillada e tes que decidir por que camiño continúa."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "You can see whether this mode is enabled or not, by looking at Tux's feet: If Tux is barefoot, \"run-fast-mode\" is disabled. And if he wears red sport shoes, \"run-fast-mode\" is enabled."
msgstr "Podes mirar para os pés de Tux para ver se o modo de correr está activado ou non. Se Tux vai descalzo, o modo de correr está desactivado. Se Tux leva unhas deportivas vermellas, o modo de correr está activado."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/ActivityInfo.qml:26
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:26
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:27
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "At higher levels, run-fast-mode will be enabled automatically. If you want to use this feature in earlier levels or want to disable it in advanced levels, click on the \"barefoot / sportshoe\" icon in the upper left corner of the screen to toggle the run-fast-mode.\t"
msgstr "Nos niveis superiores, o modo de correr actívase automaticamente. Se queres usar este modo nos primeiros niveis ou se queres desactivalo nos niveis superiores, preme a icona de «Descalzo ou calzado» na esquina superior esquerda da pantalla para activar ou desactivar o modo.\t\t"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/maze/Maze.qml:314
msgctxt "Maze|"
msgid "Look at your position, then switch back to invisible mode to continue your moves"
msgstr "Mira a túa posición, despois cambia ao modo invisíbel para continuar os teus movementos"

#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Invisible maze"
msgstr "O labirinto invisíbel"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Guide Tux out of the invisible maze."
msgstr "Saca a Tux do labirinto invisíbel."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Use the arrow keys or swipe the screen to move Tux to the door. Use the maze icon or the spacebar to switch between invisible and visible modes. Visible mode just gives you an indication of your position, like a map. You cannot move Tux in visible mode."
msgstr "Usa as teclas de frecha ou pasa o dedo pola pantalla para mover a Tux ata a porta. Usa a icona de labirinto ou o espazador para cambiar entre os modos visíbel e invisíbel. O modo visíbel simplemente fornece unha indicación da posición onde estás, como un mapa. No modo visíbel non podes mover a Tux."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:23
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "At the first levels, Tux walks comfortably, one step on each move request, through the maze."
msgstr "Nos primeiros niveis, Tux camiña comodamente, dando un paso a través do labirinto cada vez que premes a tecla correspondente."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:25
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:26
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "You can see whether this mode is enabled or not, by looking at Tux's feet: If Tux is barefooted, \"run-fast-mode\" is disabled. And if he wears red sport shoes, \"run-fast-mode\" is enabled."
msgstr "Podes mirar para os pés de Tux para ver se o modo de correr está activado ou non. Se Tux vai descalzo, o modo de correr está desactivado. Se Tux leva unhas deportivas vermellas, o modo de correr está activado."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazeinvisible/ActivityInfo.qml:29
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Space: switch between invisible and visible modes"
msgstr "Espazo: cambiar entre os modos invisíbel e visíbel"

#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Relative maze"
msgstr "Labirinto relativo"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Help Tux get out of this maze (moves are relative)."
msgstr "Axuda a Tux a saír do labirinto (os movementos son relativos)"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:23
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "In this maze, the moves are relative (first person). Left and right are used to turn and up to move forward."
msgstr "Neste labirinto, os movementos son relativos (en primeira persoa). As teclas de esquerda e dereita úsanse para xirar, e a tecla de arriba úsase para avanzar."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:29
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Left and Right arrows: turn left and right"
msgstr "Frechas esquerda e dereita: xirar á esquerda e á dereita"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:30
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Down arrow: turn backward"
msgstr "Frecha de abaixo: ir cara atrás"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/mazerelative/ActivityInfo.qml:31
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Up arrow: move forward"
msgstr "Frecha de arriba: ir cara adiante"

#. Activity title
