msgid "Nine men's morris (against Tux)"
msgstr "Muíño (contra Tux)"

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/ActivityInfo.qml:19
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Form mills (lines of 3 pieces) to remove Tux's pieces until he has only 2 pieces left or can not move anymore."
msgstr "Forma muíños (liñas de 3 pezas) para retirar as pezas de Tux ata que só resten dúas pezas ou xa non poida mover."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Play with Tux. First take turns to place nine pieces, and then take turns to move your pieces."
msgstr "Xoga con Tux. Primeiro coloca por quendas nove pezas, e a continuación movede as vosas pezas por quendas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/nine_men_morris.js:29
msgctxt "nine_men_morris|"
msgid "You and Tux start with 9 pieces each, and take turns to place your pieces on the empty spots of the board (by clicking on the spots)."
msgstr "Ti e Tux comezades con 9 pezas cada un, e por quendas colocades as pezas premendo os puntos baleiros do taboleiro."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/nine_men_morris.js:33
msgctxt "nine_men_morris|"
msgid "If you form a mill (line of 3 pieces), then select one of Tux's pieces to remove it. Pieces of formed mill can not be removed unless no other pieces are left on the board."
msgstr "Se formas un muíño (liña de 3 pezas), selecciona unha das pezas de Tux e retíraa. As pezas dun muíño non poden retirarse ata que non queden máis pezas no taboleiro."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/nine_men_morris.js:37
msgctxt "nine_men_morris|"
msgid "After all the pieces are placed, you and Tux will take turns to move them. Click on one of your pieces, and then on an adjacent empty spot to move it there. Green color spots indicates where you can move."
msgstr "Unha vez colocadas todas as pezas, ti e Tux movédeas por quendas. Preme unha das pezas, e a continuación nun punto adxacente baleiro onde queiras movela. Os puntos de cor verde son os puntos onde podes mover."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/nine_men_morris.js:41
msgctxt "nine_men_morris|"
msgid "If you are left with 3 pieces, they gain the ability to 'fly' and can be moved to any vacant spot on the board."
msgstr "Se quedas con 3 pezas, poderán “voar” e poderán moverse a calquera punto vacante do taboleiro."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/nine_men_morris/nine_men_morris.js:45
msgctxt "nine_men_morris|"
msgid "If you immobilize the computer or leave it with less than 3 pieces, then you win the game."
msgstr "Se deixas sen movementos ao computador ou o deixas con medos de 3 pezas, gañas a partida."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
