#: activities/scalesboard_weight_avoirdupois/resource/5/Data.qml:26
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid ""
"The \"oz\" symbol at the end of a number means ounce. \n"
" Drop weights on the left side to balance the scales."
msgstr ""
"O símbolo «oz» ao final dun número significa «onza»\n"
"Solta pesos na esquerda para equilibrar as balanzas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/scalesboard_weight_avoirdupois/resource/6/Data.qml:13
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Balance up to 10 pounds including ounces."
msgstr "Equilibra ata 10 libras incluíndo onzas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/scalesboard_weight_avoirdupois/resource/6/Data.qml:48
#: activities/scalesboard_weight_avoirdupois/resource/6/Data.qml:54
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid ""
"Remember, one pound (\"lb\") equals sixteen ounces (\"oz\"). \n"
" Drop the weights on the left side of the scales to balance it."
msgstr ""
"Lembra que 1 libra («lb») equivale a 16 onzas («oz»).\n"
"Solta pesos na esquerda para equilibrar as balanzas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityConfig.qml:26
msgctxt "ActivityConfig|"
msgid "Display counters"
msgstr "Amosar os contadores"

#. Activity title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:15
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Share pieces of candy"
msgstr "Compartir doces"

#. Help title
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:17
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Try to split the pieces of candy between a given number of children."
msgstr "Intenta repartir os doces entre o número indicado de persoas."

#. Help goal
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:20
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Learn division of numbers."
msgstr "Aprende a dividir números."

#. Help prerequisite
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:22
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Know how to count."
msgstr "Sabe como contar."

#. Help manual
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:24
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Follow the instructions shown on the screen: first, drag the given number of boys/girls to the center, then drag pieces of candy to each child's rectangle."
msgstr "Segue as instrucións que se mostran na pantalla: primeiro, arrastra o número de nenas e nenos indicado ao centro, e a continuación arrastra os doces ao rectángulo de cada persoa."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/ActivityInfo.qml:25
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "If there is a rest, it needs to be placed inside the candy jar."
msgstr "Se hai un resto, hai que colocalo no tarro de doces."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:13
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Maximum 25 pieces of candy and 5 kids, no rest."
msgstr "Un máximo de 25 doces e 5 amizades, sen resto."

# O nome de Paul adaptouse ao galego escollendo o nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:18
#: activities/share/resource/2/Data.qml:18
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Paul wants to share 2 pieces of candy equally between 2 of his girl friends. Can you help him? First, place the children in the center, then drag the pieces of candy to each of them."
msgstr "Martín quere compartir de maneira equitativa 2 doces con 2 amigas. Podes axudalo? Primeiro, coloca as amigas no centro, e a continuación arrastra os doces a cada unha delas."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:28
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Now he wants to share 4 pieces of candy equally among his friends."
msgstr "Agora quere compartir 4 doces de maneira equitativa coas súas amizades."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:38
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Can you now share 6 of Paul's pieces of candy equally among his friends?"
msgstr "E agora, podes compartir 6 dos doces de Martín de maneira equitativa coas súas amizades?"

# O nome de Bob adaptouse ao galego escollendo o oitavo nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:48
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Some of his friends already have pieces of candy. He wants to give them 7 more pieces so that they all have the same amount."
msgstr "Algunhas das súas amizades xa teñen doces. Quere darlles 7 doces máis de xeito que toda a xente quede coa mesma cantidade de doces."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:58
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Paul has only 12 pieces of candy left. He eats 2 pieces of candy and he gives the rest to his friends. Can you help him split equally the 10 remaining pieces of candy?"
msgstr "A Martín só lle quedan 12 doces. Come 2 deles e lles dá o resto ás súas amigas e amigos. Podes axudalo a dividir de maneira equitativa os 10 doces restantes?"

# O nome de George adaptouse ao galego escollendo o noveno nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:70
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "George wants to share 3 pieces of candy equally between 3 of his girl friends. Can he split the pieces of candy equally?"
msgstr "Adrián quere compartir 3 doces con 3 amigas. Pode repartir os doces de maneira equitativa?"

# O nome de Charles adaptouse ao galego escollendo o sexto nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:80
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Maria wants to share 6 pieces of candy equally between 3 of her friends: 1 girl and 2 boys. Can she split the pieces of candy equally?"
msgstr "María quere compartir 6 doces con 3 amizades: 1 amiga e 2 amigos. Pode María repartir os doces de maneira equitativa?"

# O nome de John adaptouse ao galego escollendo o terceiro nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:90
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "John wants to share 8 pieces of candy equally between 3 of his friends: 1 boy and 2 girls. The boy already has one. Can he make sure that they all have the same amount?"
msgstr "Xoán quere compartir 8 doces con 3 amizades: 1 amigo e 2 amigas. O amigo xa ten un doce. Pode Xoán facer que as amizades teñan a mesma cantidade?"

# O nome de Charles adaptouse ao galego escollendo o sexto nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:100
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Paul wants to share 12 pieces of candy equally between 3 of his friends: 2 boys and 1 girl. Can he split the pieces of candy equally?"
msgstr "Martín quere compartir 12 doces con 3 amizades: 2 amigos e 1 amiga. Pode Martín repartir os doces de maneira equitativa?"

# O nome de John adaptouse ao galego escollendo o terceiro nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:110
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Maria wants to share 11 pieces of candy between 3 of her friends: 1 boy and 2 girls. The girls already have some pieces of candy. Can she split the pieces of candy so that they all have the same amount?"
msgstr "María quere compartir 11 doces con 3 amizades: 1 amigo e 2 amigas. As amigas xa teñen doces. Pode María repartir os doces para que todas as amizades teñan a mesma cantidade?"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:122
#: activities/share/resource/2/Data.qml:112
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Alice wants to share 4 pieces of candy equally between 4 of her girl friends. Can you help her?"
msgstr "Martina quere compartir 4 doces de maneira equitativa con 4 amigas. Podes axudala?"

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:132
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Now, Alice wants to give 8 pieces of candy to her friends."
msgstr "Agora, Martina quere darlles 8 doces a amizades."

# O nome de Michelle adaptouse ao galego escollendo o cuarto nome de nena máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenas), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:142
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Alice wants to give 10 pieces of candy to her friends, 1 girl and 3 boys, so that they all have the same amount. The girls already have some pieces of candy."
msgstr "Martina quere darlles 10 doces a amizades, 1 amiga e 3 amigos, de xeito que todas teñan a mesma cantidade. A amiga xa ten algúns doces."

#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:152
msgctxt "Data|"
msgid "Alice wants to give 16 pieces of candy to her friends."
msgstr "Martina quere darlles 16 doces a amizades."

# O nome de Bob adaptouse ao galego escollendo o oitavo nome de neno máis popular en Galicia de 2015 (http://ilg.usc.es/nomes_galicia/?nomes=nenos), a falta de datos máis actuais.
#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/share/resource/1/Data.qml:162
msgctxt "Data|"
