#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: activities/solar_system/QuizScreen.qml:276
#, qt-format
msgctxt "QuizScreen|"
msgid ""
"Your final score is: <font color=\"#3bb0de\">%1%</font>.<br>"
"<br>"
"%2"
