#. +> trunk5
#: activities/tens_complement_calculate/ActivityInfo.qml:19
msgctxt "ActivityInfo|"
msgid "Learn to use ten's complement to optimize the order of numbers in an operation and calculate the result."
msgstr "Aprende a usar o complemento de 10 para optimizar a orde dos números nunha operación e calcula o resultado."

